{"ID": 1348788729384276121, "Timestamp": "2025-03-10 22:44:52", "Contents": "It’s a good idea. We can assign a category to one or a group of people before a competition, but I don’t think it should be permanent. For a lot of us, this is our first year competing and getting familiar with the categories and our preferences, and we may not be ready to specialize in one just yet. I think it’s important for us to strike a balance between being ultra-competitive and getting a diverse cyber skill-set for the outside world.", "Attachments": ""},
